{"l":8910,"g":9,"b":2,"cefr":"C1","role":"deep_challenge","insight":"perspective_shift","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord betyder det modsatte af 'reckless' i 'reckless cycling'?","o":["cautious","speedy","noisy","daily"],"a":"cautious","r":"'Reckless' betyder hensynsløs og uforsigtig, så det modsatte er 'cautious' (forsigtig)."},
{"l":8950,"g":9,"b":2,"cefr":"C1","role":"deep_challenge","insight":"perspective_shift","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad hedder 'udholdenhed' på engelsk i 'Running a marathon requires a great deal of ___.'?","o":["assurance","endurance","allowance","abundance"],"a":"endurance","r":"'Endurance' betyder udholdenhed. 'Assurance' er forsikring eller selvsikkerhed, og 'allowance' er lommepenge eller tilladelse."},
{"l":8990,"g":9,"b":2,"cefr":"C1","role":"deep_challenge","insight":"perspective_shift","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'The experiment was ___ under strict laboratory conditions.'","o":["conduced","induced","conducted","deduced"],"a":"conducted","r":"'Conduct an experiment' betyder at udføre et forsøg. De andre ord ligner, men betyder noget andet."},
