{"l":9090,"g":9,"b":2,"cefr":"C1","role":"deep_challenge","insight":"perspective_shift","k":"h","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad siger man på engelsk, når man vil sige, at det er ligegyldigt for én, så den anden bare kan vælge?","o":["It's up to me then.","It's on the same page.","It's all over to me.","It's all the same to me."],"a":"It's all the same to me.","r":"'It's all the same to me' betyder, at man ikke har nogen præference. 'It's up to me' betyder, at man selv skal bestemme."},
